			"notes": "# PlayerESP Fabric v1.0.0\n\nClient-side ESP mod for Minecraft 1.21.4 Fabric.\n\n## Features\n- Player name & hitbox ESP with customizable colors\n- Whitelist system with in-game GUI (`J` key)\n- Commands: `/pesp on/off`, `/pesp whitelist <players>`, `/pesp color <r g b>`\n- Keybinds: `H` (hitbox), `N` (names)\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.4 + Fabric Loader 0.15.0+ + Fabric API\n- Java 21+"
